WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.065
- [Amber] Hey Buzzfeed,
it's your girl Amber,

00:00:03.065 --> 00:00:07.251
aka @jstlbby and here's
a little bit about me.

00:00:07.251 --> 00:00:08.917
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.917 --> 00:00:10.664
- [Narrator] Amber Wagner,
aka @jstlbby, gained fame

00:00:10.664 --> 00:00:13.417
with her witty inspirational videos.

00:00:13.417 --> 00:00:14.384
(upbeat music)

00:00:14.384 --> 00:00:16.025
- I've noticed that you've kind of been

00:00:16.025 --> 00:00:17.407
hard on yourself, you feel me?

00:00:17.407 --> 00:00:18.910
Right now, I want you to take a minute

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:21.044
and thank your damn self.

00:00:21.044 --> 00:00:23.851
Hug yourself if you can, you feel me?

00:00:23.851 --> 00:00:25.848
Pat your damn self on the back.

00:00:25.848 --> 00:00:28.326
I grew up in a two-parent home
with my mother and father.

00:00:28.326 --> 00:00:29.874
In Englewood, California.

00:00:29.874 --> 00:00:32.186
I'm very ghetto, loud,
always playing double-dutch

00:00:32.186 --> 00:00:34.216
walking to the corner
store, eatin' too much.

00:00:34.216 --> 00:00:35.480
You know, kid stuff.

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:38.619
I always had an outgoing,
bubbly personality.

00:00:38.619 --> 00:00:41.969
I'm always loud, always
rambunctious, clumsy as hell.

00:00:41.969 --> 00:00:43.136
Just me, wild.

00:00:44.289 --> 00:00:47.300
I got on Instagram in 2014 and uh, I just

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.820
started there with just regular pictures.

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:52.419
Then one day, I had um, did a video

00:00:52.419 --> 00:00:53.595
about my ex.

00:00:53.595 --> 00:00:56.324
Hey 'ista, my ex tried
to get back with me,

00:00:56.324 --> 00:00:57.419
you know what I said?

00:00:57.419 --> 00:01:00.836
Hell no, bitch! (laughs)

00:01:03.522 --> 00:01:04.823
And that went viral.

00:01:04.823 --> 00:01:08.494
Then I did a video off of
Beyonce's song Drunk in Love.

00:01:08.494 --> 00:01:10.443
So, every since I heard Beyonce sing

00:01:10.443 --> 00:01:13.416
♪ I've been drinking watermelon ♪

00:01:13.416 --> 00:01:16.192
Bitch, me too! The fuck!

00:01:16.192 --> 00:01:18.242
The first time I realized
that this could be something

00:01:18.242 --> 00:01:21.250
big was when the Shade Room
had posted me on their page.

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:23.778
After that, celebrities
started posting me,

00:01:23.778 --> 00:01:25.690
they started following me and I was like,

00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:27.689
okay, this is serious now.

00:01:27.689 --> 00:01:30.618
What made me want to be
motivational was just my life,

00:01:30.618 --> 00:01:32.777
I was in a dark place
for awhile, you know,

00:01:32.777 --> 00:01:35.300
dealing with these guys
usin' and abusin' me

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:37.788
and then me just not
really fully lovin' myself

00:01:37.788 --> 00:01:39.092
and knowin' who I was.

00:01:39.092 --> 00:01:42.433
And once I did, I don't know,
a sense just came over me

00:01:42.433 --> 00:01:45.609
like you know what, you
need to put this out there.

00:01:45.609 --> 00:01:48.382
My mother is like my biggest
inspiration, motivator

00:01:48.382 --> 00:01:52.285
and everything because that
woman is just so strong.

00:01:52.285 --> 00:01:54.690
Like, she has been through
so much from hip surgery,

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:56.635
shoulder surgery, everything.

00:01:56.635 --> 00:01:59.727
Still helping my grandfather
who was bed-ridden.

00:01:59.727 --> 00:02:01.940
Brushing his teeth, making his meals.

00:02:01.940 --> 00:02:04.707
And she still remains
positive, still remains happy.

00:02:04.707 --> 00:02:06.251
Still just does her best.

00:02:06.251 --> 00:02:08.677
At first when I started
social media, she told me

00:02:08.677 --> 00:02:11.026
"you're not funny, nobody's
going to like you".

00:02:11.026 --> 00:02:12.367
I'm like, okay.

00:02:12.367 --> 00:02:14.259
And I was crying, I was so sad.

00:02:14.259 --> 00:02:17.067
Next thing you know, I showed
her I was in the Shade Room

00:02:17.067 --> 00:02:18.493
and I showed her where
Rihanna was following me

00:02:18.493 --> 00:02:21.009
and other people, then
she made a Instagram.

00:02:21.009 --> 00:02:23.735
Now she loves it. She wears
my T-shirt out in public.

00:02:23.735 --> 00:02:25.365
People say, "oh my god, you know her?"

00:02:25.365 --> 00:02:27.312
She's like, "Yes, that's my daughter."

00:02:27.312 --> 00:02:30.242
Okay, so, when I'm in my zone,
getting ready to do my videos

00:02:30.242 --> 00:02:31.947
I'm usually at my desk, okay.

00:02:31.947 --> 00:02:33.942
I have my phone here and I
have to get my mind right.

00:02:33.942 --> 00:02:36.671
So, I think of a topic.
For instance, heartbreak.

00:02:36.671 --> 00:02:39.476
So, in my head, niggas I
ain't shared, okay, nuh-uh

00:02:39.476 --> 00:02:41.028
they doggin' us out, whatever.

00:02:41.028 --> 00:02:43.025
So I'm like, okay, let me get ready.

00:02:43.025 --> 00:02:44.938
I usually, you know, you know me.

00:02:44.938 --> 00:02:48.124
Put my glasses on, I'm in my zone, so.

00:02:48.124 --> 00:02:50.402
Hey, Valentine's Day is tomorrow.

00:02:50.402 --> 00:02:53.210
I'm single, and I ain't
even trippin'. It's okay.

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:55.743
I just speak, like, you
know, about who I am

00:02:55.743 --> 00:02:57.658
and situations that I've been through.

00:02:57.658 --> 00:02:59.532
And you know, with me
being like, plus size,

00:02:59.532 --> 00:03:01.522
I want to help the plus size young ladies.

00:03:01.522 --> 00:03:03.117
And people ask me how do I do it?

00:03:03.117 --> 00:03:05.518
I say, I just, honestly
what I did, I just pray

00:03:05.518 --> 00:03:08.822
about it and I just keep
going. Everything is pure.

00:03:08.822 --> 00:03:10.576
It's nothin' forced.

00:03:10.576 --> 00:03:13.786
The message I would like to
send to younger females of color

00:03:13.786 --> 00:03:16.918
is embrace yourself, don't base how other

00:03:16.918 --> 00:03:18.507
people feel about you,

00:03:18.507 --> 00:03:20.010
how you feel about yourself.

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:21.840
Don't let anybody
deteriorate you, deter you

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:25.706
from what you're doing.
Just keep being you.

00:03:25.706 --> 00:03:28.373
You are the mother-fucking shit.

00:03:30.373 --> 00:03:31.540
You are great.

00:03:33.023 --> 00:03:35.482
- You're actually a queen.
You inspire me so much.

00:03:35.482 --> 00:03:37.041
You really are. I'm so sorry.

00:03:37.041 --> 00:03:38.730
- No, I appreciate your positivity.

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:39.563
Thank you.

00:03:39.563 --> 00:03:41.090
Give me another hug, that just made my day

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:42.537
- Oh my god.

00:03:42.537 --> 00:03:45.120
(Upbeat music)

